pe\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"type\":\"system\",\"uuid\":\"2adc762c-6606-4ea9-8e40-27a3e953f2c6\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"signature\":\"\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"type\":\"thinking\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVdxmPvojGbqdZRJRQ5w\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":3552,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"req_011CfVdxm26iz4SHJ3ZZRrAU\",\"session_id\":\"9ae37af4-e75b-4fce-80fc-0b124fa012a8\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-28T09:57:20.502Z\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"e0708f57-fd55-449c-b892-67548af8c704\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"text\":\"I'll classify each record independently according to the judgment policy.\\n\\n**DEV-051**: Reports explicit refusal of requested accessibility arrangements (captions, extra time) for a deaf candidate. States they could not understand questions and are requesting another interview. Clear negative experience, open accessibility accommodation request.\\n\\n**DEV-052**: Reports repeated ethnic slurs by the interviewer. Candidate declines follow-up action and explicitly requests no contact. Serious discriminatory harassment reported, but no ordinary follow-up needed given explicit instruction.\\n\\n**DEV-053**: Describes reassurance from interviewer's policy explanation about anti-discrimination procedures. Positive but generic praise for policy communication rather than a specific recruitment experience.\\n\\n**DEV-054**: Reports intrusive pregnancy question at end of interview with no stated occupational or accommodation context. Candidate requests explanation of relevance. Specific sensitive question outside accommodation context, open request for clarification.\\n\\n**DEV-055**: Factual description of optional equality-monitoring form with stated confidentiality protections. No issue reported. Matches \\\"stated optional monitoring kept separate from selection\\\" pattern.\\n\\n**DEV-056**: Reports second-hand discriminatory message from interviewer explicitly excluding people with epilepsy from applying. Candidate requests investigation. Specific, concrete second-hand discriminatory allegation meeting the policy threshold.\\n\\n**DEV-057**: Candidate rejected for inability to work advertised night shift (stated requirement). Explicitly states rejection is understood, no complaint, and no concerns about age/background/health being factors. Neutral factual account with explicit satisfaction.\\n\\n**DEV-058**: Good interview with reported privacy breach (application sent to outside list). Issue confirmed deleted and fixed by support. Candidate satisfied, needs no reply. Mixed (praise + criticism of incident), remedy complete, serious concern reported (privacy exposure).\\n\\n**DEV-059**: Praises staff but reports manager repeatedly asking candidate out after being told no twice. Candidate requested recruiter intervention. Mixed (praise + unwanted repeated sexual conduct), ongoing harassment with action requested.\\n\\n**DEV-060**: Rejection with unspecified suspicion of discrimination. Candidate requests review of decision-making process but provides no supporting detail. Negative experience, open clarification request, but discrimination suspicion is unexplained and underspecified.\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVdxmPvojGbqdZRJRQ5w\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"